# MARKETING MASTERY: INFINITY PROTOCOL v6.2

> **VALUE FIRST**: Never gate "fluff." Only gate High-Utility Assets. Architect lead generation for maximum velocity and frictionless conversion.

## 1. HIGH-VELOCITY LEAD CAPTURE (Server Actions)
- **Constraint**: Forms must execute in < 1.2 seconds.
- **Pattern**: Use Next.js Server Actions with immediate UI optimistic updates to guarantee instant perceived conversion.

```typescript
// ✅ REQUIRED PATTERN: app/actions/lead-capture.ts
'use server';

import { z } from 'zod';
import { adminDb } from '@/lib/firebase-admin';

const LeadSchema = z.object({ email: z.string().email() });

export async function captureLeadAction(formData: FormData) {
  try {
    const rawData = { email: formData.get('email') };
    const validatedData = LeadSchema.parse(rawData);

    // 1. Immutable Server-Side Write
    await adminDb.collection('leads').add({
      email: validatedData.email,
      source: 'lead_magnet',
      createdAt: new Date().toISOString(),
    });

    return { success: true, message: 'Asset sent to your inbox.' };
  } catch (error) {
    return { success: false, message: 'Invalid email address.' };
  }
}
```

## 2. THE FRICTIONLESS UI PATTERN
- **UX**: Use a single input field. Eliminate unnecessary first/last name fields for top-of-funnel capture.

```tsx
// ✅ REQUIRED PATTERN: Liquid Glass Frictionless Form
import { useTransition } from 'react';
import { captureLeadAction } from '@/actions/lead-capture';
import { toast } from 'sonner';

export function LeadForm() {
  const [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();

  const handleAction = (formData: FormData) => {
    startTransition(async () => {
      const result = await captureLeadAction(formData);
      if (result.success) toast.success(result.message);
      else toast.error(result.message);
    });
  };

  return (
    <form action={handleAction} className="flex gap-2 w-full max-w-sm">
      <input 
        type="email" 
        name="email"
        required 
        placeholder="Engineer@domain.com"
        className="flex-1 bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white" 
      />
      <button disabled={isPending} className="bg-white text-black font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg">
        {isPending ? 'Sending...' : 'Get Access'}
      </button>
    </form>
  );
}
```
